findings.remediation:
Add a server_side_encryption_configuration block:
resource "aws_s3_bucket_server_side_encryption_configuration" "this" {
  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.this.id
  rule {
    apply_server_side_encryption_by_default {
      sse_algorithm = "AES256"  # or "aws:kms" with kms_master_key_id
    }
    bucket_key_enabled = true
  }
}

Enable deletion protection to prevent accidental destruction:
resource "aws_db_instance" "this" {
  deletion_protection = true
}
For S3, remove `force_destroy = true`. For EC2, set `disable_api_termination = true`.

Enable Multi-AZ for high availability and automatic failover:
resource "aws_db_instance" "this" {
  multi_az = true
}

